                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 365.117/341a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to Chargé Jay
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-05-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 22, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>554. Department’s instruction 276, January 25, concerning detention John Zuffi.
                    Urge early decision, report.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
